   Fe 1.0 2.0 3.0
   O  3.0 2.0 1.0
CELL_PARAMETERS {angstrom}
   3.0 1.0 0.0
   0.0 4.0 1.0
   1.0 0.0 5.0
K_POINTS {automatic}
   4 4 4 0 0 0
